{
  "job_B23.3.1.5_20251003_114604": {
    "text": "Se\u00f0e on anre nihte monan weor\u00f0e\u00f0 untrum, se bi\u00f0 on \u00f0\u00e6re adle swi\u00f0e geswenced.\nOn II nihta monan, hra\u00f0e \u00e6fter sare he arise\u00f0.\nGif on III he winne\u00f0, & eft in \u00fe\u00e6re untrumnesse se mon swelte\u00f0.\nGif on IIII, he winne\u00f0 & eft arise\u00f0.\nGif on V, ne gedege\u00f0 \u00fee \u00fea adle.\nGif on VI, he winne\u00f0 & arise\u00f0.\nOn VII nihte aldne monnan, he sceal feala findan, butan him mihtig God milde wur\u00fee, f\u00e6rlice hine dea\u00f0\nGif he bi\u00f0 an VIII, ne leofe\u00f0 he na lange.\nGif on IX, he bi\u00f0 lange seoc.\nGif on X, on his heortan unh\u00e6lo cym\u00f0, & he bi\u00f0 fr\u00e6cno\u00f0.\nGif on XI, on langum sare he sarga\u00f0, & he gelomlice his h\u00e6lo hafo\u00f0 eft.\nGif on XII, he winne\u00f0 & eft arise\u00f0.\nOn XIII, lytel sticce he lige\u00f0 seoc.\nOn XIIII, he winne\u00f0 & arise\u00f0.\nGif on XV, fr\u00e6clice bi\u00f0 his \u00feing.\nGif on XVI, on \u00fe\u00e6re stowe he arise\u00f0.\nGif on XVII, he swince\u00f0 & eft arise\u00f0.\nOn XVIII, he winne\u00f0 & eft arise\u00f0.\nOn XIX, he winne\u00f0 & arise\u00f0.\nOn XX, he arise\u00f0.\nOn XXI, he bi\u00f0 lange seoc.\nOn XXII, r\u00e6dlice he hal arise\u00f0.\nOn XXIII, he arise\u00f0.\nOn XXIIII, he bi\u00f0 langa lama & swelte\u00f0.\nOn XXV, he hra\u00fee arise\u00f0.\nGif on XXVI & on XXVII, frecne bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s mannes \u00feing, \u00fe\u00e6t ifel unea\u00f0e befli\u00f0.\nOn XXVIII & on XXIX, he of \u00feam sare sone arise\u00f0.\nGif XXX, he bi\u00f0 lange seoc, \u00fe\u00e6hwe\u00f0ere arise\u00f0.\n\u00d0is is eallum gem\u00e6ne iungum and ealdum.",
